 * attach files to articles, that attachment metadata is properly stored and
 * returned, and that the system correctly handles the maximum attachment limit
 * of 10 files per article.
 *
 * Test workflow:
 *
 * 1. Authenticate contributor via join endpoint
 * 2. Create article with title, content, category, and multiple attachments
 * 3. Verify response includes complete attachment metadata
 * 4. Verify each attachment has all required properties (id, filename, type, size,
 *    mime_type, timestamp, url, uploader)
 * 5. Validate that attachment URLs are properly linked to articles
 */
